# Verification

## Evidence levels

| Level | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| Compiled | The target builds or validates structurally |
| Traced | The relevant path was inspected end to end |
| Tested | An automated assertion passed |
| Click-tested | Running UI behavior was exercised |
| Measured | A numeric target was sampled and recorded |
| Packaged | An installable artifact was produced and inspected |
| Released | Publication or deployment actually completed |

